  "descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "Dimensional Human Field Theory (DHFT) \u2014 Formal System Repository\n\nThis repository houses the formal source architecture for Dimensional Human Field Theory (DHFT), a closed explanatory system within Structural Stability Science (SSS).\n\nDHFT is specified through Load (L), Capacity (C), and Boundary (B), together with the Structural Identification Method (SIM), Load\u2013Capacity\u2013Boundary Mechanics (LCB), admissibility conditions, falsifiability conditions, system constraints, technical notes, projection notes, domain governance records, public briefings, deployment records, and authorized-use boundaries.\n\nThis repository functions as the primary source-navigation surface for DHFT and associated SSS / SIM / LCB records. It preserves source hierarchy, dependency order, variable identity, structural relations, and authorized-use constraints.\n\nPublic access to this repository does not authorize assessment, audit, certification, training, institutional deployment, machine use, practitioner use, teacher training, professional implementation, curriculum licensing, or derivative method development. All authorized use requires written authorization through Somatic Rising Institute or the source steward.\n\nFoundational Source Records\n\nTonucci, Cara, Dimensional Human Field Theory (DHFT) Architectural Identification of a Closed Explanatory System (February 17, 2026). Available at SSRN: https://ssrn.com/abstract=6259999 or http://dx.doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6259999\n\nTonucci, Cara, Minimal Stability Geometry of Dimensional Human Physics (March 16, 2026). Available at SSRN: https://ssrn.com/abstract=6428361 or http://dx.doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6428361\n\nTonucci, Cara, Stability Field Dynamics in Dimensional Human Physics Mathematical Mechanics within Dimensional Human Field Theory (March 17, 2026). Available at SSRN: https://ssrn.com/abstract=6433738 or http://dx.doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6433738\n\nStewardship &amp; Governance\n\nSomatic Rising Institute (SRI)\nWebsite: somaticrisinginstitute.org\n\nCara Tonucci ORCID: https://orcid.org/\n0009-0003-9048-5821",
      "descriptionType": "Abstract"
    }
  ],
